diff --git a/features/methodology.feature b/features/methodology.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b54e8a7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/methodology.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+Feature: Methodology conformance
+  Verification-support and harbour-hygiene checks. Non-binding until Captain promotes them;
+  QM authors the executable checks at promotion.
+
+  @captain @conformance
+  Scenario: watchbill.json conforms to its fixed shape
+    Given a "watchbill.json" exists
+    Then every watch entry is named "watch<n>"
+    And each watch holds only a "scenarios" array of "<spec>.feature:<Scenario Name>" references or a tier tag
+    And no watch carries prose, metadata, or hidden context
+
+  @captain @conformance
+  Scenario: No standing PERTURBATION token remains
+    When the implementation is scanned for the token "PERTURBATION"
+    Then no "PERTURBATION" statement is found in production code
diff --git a/features/todo-clear.feature b/features/todo-clear.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..761cb5d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-clear.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+Feature: Clear completed
+  The clear-completed control removes completed todos and hides itself when none remain.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I check "Buy milk"
+    When I click ".clear-completed"
+    Then ".todo-list" contains 1 item
+    And the remaining item is "Walk dog"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Clear completed is hidden when nothing is completed
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    Then ".clear-completed" is hidden
diff --git a/features/todo-counter.feature b/features/todo-counter.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..23ac878
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-counter.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+Feature: Active item counter
+  The footer counter shows the number of active (incomplete) todos, pluralized.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Counter shows one active item
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I check "Buy milk"
+    Then ".todo-count" shows "1 item left"
+    And the count number is wrapped in a "<strong>" tag
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Counter pluralizes two active items
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk", "Walk dog", and "Read book"
+    And I check "Buy milk"
+    Then ".todo-count" shows "2 items left"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Counter reads zero items
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+    Then ".todo-count" shows "0 items left"
diff --git a/features/todo-create.feature b/features/todo-create.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..62a9ef4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-create.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+Feature: New todo creation
+  As a user I add todos through the top input.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: New todo input is focused on page load
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+    When the page has finished loading
+    Then the ".new-todo" input is focused
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Enter creates a todo, appends it, and clears the input
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+    When I type "Buy milk" into ".new-todo" and press Enter
+    Then ".todo-list" contains 1 item with label "Buy milk"
+    And the ".new-todo" input value is empty
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only and empty input creates no todo
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+    When I type "   " into ".new-todo" and press Enter
+    Then ".todo-list" contains 0 items
+    And the ".new-todo" input value is empty
diff --git a/features/todo-display.feature b/features/todo-display.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7a34154
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-display.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+Feature: List visibility when empty
+  When there are no todos, the main and footer regions are hidden.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+    Then the ".main" section is hidden
+    And the ".footer" section is hidden
diff --git a/features/todo-editing.feature b/features/todo-editing.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9261a6a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-editing.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@
+Feature: Inline editing of a todo
+  Double-clicking a label opens an edit field that saves on blur or Enter.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Double-clicking the label enters editing mode
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the label of "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "editing"
+    And the ".edit" input is focused
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Editing saves on Enter and trims
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    And I double-click the label of "Buy milk"
+    When I set the ".edit" input to "  Buy oat milk  " and press Enter
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" no longer has class "editing"
+    And the label of "Buy milk" is "Buy oat milk"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Empty edit destroys the todo
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    And I double-click the label of "Buy milk"
+    When I set the ".edit" input to "   " and press Enter
+    Then ".todo-list" contains 0 items
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Editing saves on blur and trims
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    And I double-click the label of "Buy milk"
+    When I set the ".edit" input to "  Buy oat milk  " and blur it
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" no longer has class "editing"
+    And the label of "Buy milk" is "Buy oat milk"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Empty edit on blur destroys the todo
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    And I double-click the label of "Buy milk"
+    When I set the ".edit" input to "   " and blur it
+    Then ".todo-list" contains 0 items
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Escape discards the edit
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    And I double-click the label of "Buy milk"
+    When I set the ".edit" input to "Changed" and press Escape
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" no longer has class "editing"
+    And the label of "Buy milk" is "Buy milk"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Each item renders a destroy button
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" contains a ".destroy" button
