@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+Feature: Per-item completion and bulk toggle
+  Checking a single todo marks it complete; the toggle-all control manages every item.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Checking an item marks it completed
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    When I check the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "completed"
+    And its "completed" value is true
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checks every item and reflects their state
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    When I check "#toggle-all"
+    Then every todo has class "completed"
+    And "#toggle-all" is checked
+    When I uncheck one todo
+    Then "#toggle-all" is unchecked
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Toggle-all is cleared after Clear completed
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I check "Buy milk"
+    When I click ".clear-completed"
+    Then "#toggle-all" is unchecked
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Clicking destroy removes the todo
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    When I click the destroy button of "Buy milk"
+    Then ".todo-list" contains 1 item
+    And the remaining item is "Walk dog"
