@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+Feature: Persistence to localStorage
+  Todos persist across reload; each item stores id, title, and completed.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Todos persist across reload
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    When I reload the app
+    Then ".todo-list" contains 1 item with label "Buy milk"
+    And localStorage key "todos-vanillajs" is present
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Each item stores id, title, and completed
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    Then localStorage "todos-vanillajs" stores an item with id, title "Buy milk", and completed false
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Editing state is not persisted
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk"
+    And I double-click the label of "Buy milk"
+    When I reload the app
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" does not have class "editing"
