@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+Feature: Hash routing and filtering
+  Routes #/, #/active, and #/completed filter the list on a model level and toggle the
+  selected filter link; an in-page anchor click changes the hash and fires routing.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Default route shows all todos
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    Then all todos are visible
+    And the ".selected" filter link is "All"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Active route shows only incomplete todos
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I check "Buy milk"
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then only "Walk dog" is visible
+    And the ".selected" filter link is "Active"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Completed route shows only completed todos
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I check "Buy milk"
+    When I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then only "Buy milk" is visible
+    And the ".selected" filter link is "Completed"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Checking an item in a filtered view hides it
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    And I navigate to "#/active"
+    When I check "Walk dog"
+    Then "Walk dog" is no longer visible
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Active filter persists across reload
+    Given the app is loaded with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+    When I navigate to "#/completed"
+    And I reload the app
+    Then the ".selected" filter link is "Completed"
